{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"851700100966776853","content":"Bits of wood and buildings are working to build themselves back into buildings. Pulling themselves together. Objects of kings bridge have life. Not all have sentience. Not all have voices. But they will knit together, and heal over time.","created_at":"2021-07-16T11:55:11.643000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865562207529730078","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
