{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851700100966776853","content":"Apgan has finished his short rest and will assist Jonathan if need be.","created_at":"2021-07-17T07:28:43.994000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865857538335834112","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Gor-eal","id":"859432639681134592","is_bot":0,"username":"gorealthundhal"},"author_id":"859432639681134592","channel_id":"851700100966776853","content":"\"Thank you Apgan\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T07:29:26.688000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865857717406531634","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851700100966776853","content":"\"It is an honor to serve the people of Empire City with you.\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T07:29:50.281000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865857816362352640","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Gor-eal","id":"859432639681134592","is_bot":0,"username":"gorealthundhal"},"author_id":"859432639681134592","channel_id":"851700100966776853","content":"\"I just hope that we can save the people before it's too late. The strategy that the soldiers are partaking in is not something that I have seen in a long time\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T07:31:54.837000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865858338788999169","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851700100966776853","content":"\"I am not familiar with this strategy, only with the effects it has been having on the city.\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T07:33:01.565000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865858618665992212","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851700100966776853","content":"\"The conscriptions wound me deeply, as an Arcanian. The guardians have always given Arcania peace. Should there not be somewhere in the world which knows peace from the Godwar?\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T07:34:43.884000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865859047822852117","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851700100966776853","content":"\"Yet I cannot bring myself to fully blame the British, to seek victory by any means necessary. How can one choose between peace and victory?\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T07:37:10.339000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865859662099775499","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Gor-eal","id":"859432639681134592","is_bot":0,"username":"gorealthundhal"},"author_id":"859432639681134592","channel_id":"851700100966776853","content":"\"My mother was Arcanian as well, and what the Goddess Athena tells us that there is no victory without peace. What my countrymen have done here will never result in peace, and that is where they lose. The wounds run deep and may never heal. But we must keep moving and have hope.\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T07:40:41.153000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865860546318303252","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851700100966776853","content":"\"I am reminded of the wars my people fought with jackalope tribes, to know that even in the peace of Arcania there will still be violence. I remember thinking that to die for victory there was sweet. To kill in battle was sweeter.\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T07:45:08.434000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865861667376332800","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851700100966776853","content":"\"Yet it all seems so small now, and now that I know how great in scale war can be, how petty those conflicts seem.\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T07:45:54.952000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865861862486441994","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851700100966776853","content":"\"But peace, peace is always sweet.\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T07:46:15.724000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865861949610131467","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851700100966776853","content":"\"And then, thought of thoughts, it seems as there's nothing else worth fighting for.\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T07:47:11.189000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865862182247727114","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Gor-eal","id":"859432639681134592","is_bot":0,"username":"gorealthundhal"},"author_id":"859432639681134592","channel_id":"851700100966776853","content":"\"When I joined the war against the French, going in I had gone to seek glory, and I thought I had found it. But then I turned back to see all the innocents that had died, My comrades, My countrymen, And My people. It was then that I realized that the war I was fighting Had cost many people there lives. Yet then I began to think of the lives they would have lived If I had just surrendered. In many ways they would be living lives that are very similar to what we find ourselves in now. There is very little that is worth going to war over, yet many do. Some for power, some for glory, and some for intolerance. There is only one ideal that I have found worth fighting for, and I'm afraid that it had eluded me for some time, and that is peace\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T07:53:14.806000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865863707366916138","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851700100966776853","content":"\"To fight for peace. I could not imagine anything more self-defeating on its face, and yet somehow I cannot but agree.\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T07:54:54.940000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865864127359352852","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851700100966776853","content":"\"Do you know why I left my tribe?\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T07:55:21.765000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865864239872737290","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Gor-eal","id":"859432639681134592","is_bot":0,"username":"gorealthundhal"},"author_id":"859432639681134592","channel_id":"851700100966776853","content":"\"I do not, why is that\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T07:56:10.690000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865864445078798377","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851700100966776853","content":"\"A disagreement over spoils. There is not supposed to be a 'strongest' Tatankan, or a 'bravest' Tatankan, yet I was one. We are supposed to hide our strengths and cover up other's weaknesses until we are all just one. I didn't fit into that. I couldn't.\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T07:58:13.524000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865864960281673738","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851700100966776853","content":"\"I knew victory in battle too well--I delighted in combat, and began to believe that I deserved a greater share of the spoils. It was always denied. One day I refused to fight unless they granted me the prizes I asked for--a trinket, nothing more.\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T07:59:19.639000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865865237588738099","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851700100966776853","content":"\"They refused, and I did not fight the next day. Nor the day after. Nor after that. Until one of my number died. He was dear to me.\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T08:01:14.015000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865865717316452372","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851700100966776853","content":"\"I came out on the battlefield one last time and fought as no Tatankan fights--without the group, always charging ahead without them. We won, but I was lost. I knew I could never fight as the Tatankan demanded again. So I headed East.\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T08:02:28.313000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865866028944982016","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Gor-eal","id":"859432639681134592","is_bot":0,"username":"gorealthundhal"},"author_id":"859432639681134592","channel_id":"851700100966776853","content":"\"Then you too may have learned a valuable lesson that day\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T08:03:52.366000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865866381487767562","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851700100966776853","content":"\"That I am too prideful to serve my community?\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T08:04:27.565000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865866529123729438","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Gor-eal","id":"859432639681134592","is_bot":0,"username":"gorealthundhal"},"author_id":"859432639681134592","channel_id":"851700100966776853","content":"\"That if a need to fight does arise, and there is fire in your heart, then you must fight or lose something even more important\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T08:06:45.105000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865867106007908382","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851700100966776853","content":"\"A harsh lesson.\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T08:11:05.193000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865868196895653908","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Gor-eal","id":"859432639681134592","is_bot":0,"username":"gorealthundhal"},"author_id":"859432639681134592","channel_id":"851700100966776853","content":"\"But a lesson nonetheless. We can always learn from our past, in many ways it is our hope for the future\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T08:13:10.195000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865868721192697868","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Gor-eal","id":"859432639681134592","is_bot":0,"username":"gorealthundhal"},"author_id":"859432639681134592","channel_id":"851700100966776853","content":"\"You fight well, and you fight hard. There is nothing wrong with want for spoils. Pride is nothing to be ashamed of either. I thought I once knew the solution to the troubles here but that is no more.\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T08:16:19.147000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865869513714171914","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Gor-eal","id":"859432639681134592","is_bot":0,"username":"gorealthundhal"},"author_id":"859432639681134592","channel_id":"851700100966776853","content":"\"It is in my lot to fight for those who cannot fight for themselves, to suffer if need be, to kill if there is no other way, and to proudly die if there is the call for it. It is my nature\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T08:18:16.084000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865870004184547358","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Gor-eal","id":"859432639681134592","is_bot":0,"username":"gorealthundhal"},"author_id":"859432639681134592","channel_id":"851700100966776853","content":"\"Perhaps it is your nature as well\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T08:18:42.714000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865870115878469682","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851700100966776853","content":"\"I have already died once for the people of Empire City.\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T08:19:51.109000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865870402746843156","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851700100966776853","content":"\"But I think there is shame in a pride that calls for you to abandon all the people you've ever loved in order to feed it, a gnawing, hungry thing.\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T08:21:30.275000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865870818679586866","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"851700100966776853","content":"\"Yet, even if I regret my reasons for travel, I do not regret my travels. The world is much bigger than ever I knew.\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T08:22:09.388000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865870982731530280","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Gor-eal","id":"859432639681134592","is_bot":0,"username":"gorealthundhal"},"author_id":"859432639681134592","channel_id":"851700100966776853","content":"\"That is why hubris is considered a fatal flaw in many characters of fiction. I'm glad you do not regret your actions, but I do think you should learn to take pride in who you are as a person. And if you are afraid of being too prideful then a good friend will be there to keep you in check, or the gods will find another way to humble you. But being aware of your pride already puts you a league above most\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T08:28:20.041000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865872537362628608","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
